# ─── KTX local state (never commit) ─────────────────────────
# Secrets (API keys, warehouse password), sqlite state/search indexes,
# caches, runtime daemon files, and generated agent bundles. A fresh
# clone rebuilds all of this with `ktx setup` + `ktx admin runtime install`.
.ktx/

# ─── Scan snapshots and enrichment artifacts ─────────────────
# Regenerable via `ktx scan`. Contains timestamped directories that grow
# unbounded with every scan, plus embeddings.json (tens of thousands of
# lines of floats, ~$0.001 to regenerate via OpenAI embeddings). The
# curated output lives in semantic-layer/ and wiki/, which ARE versioned.
raw-sources/
